(1720503, 232833, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun happy image but I find it way overexposed. The colors are pretty, but the harsh lighting washes out parts of it and creates dark shadows that dim the pretty coloration.</td>', 'Fun happy image but I find it way overexposed. The colors are pretty, but the harsh lighting washes out parts of it and creates dark shadows that dim the pretty coloration.', '2005-09-19 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720504, 233007, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very impressive action image with a thousand stories. 7 on first pass.</td>', 'A very impressive action image with a thousand stories. 7 on first pass.', '2005-09-19 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720505, 232966, 22734, '<td valign="top">Way to go!</td>', 'Way to go!', '2005-09-19 09:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720506, 232996, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the Buddhist children. The DOF is good but the lighting seems a tad harsh. I like the orange and yellow corlorations. Maybe a zoom to get a closer detailing of ONE of the faces might''ve served you a bit better.</td>', 'I love the Buddhist children. The DOF is good but the lighting seems a tad harsh. I like the orange and yellow corlorations. Maybe a zoom to get a closer detailing of ONE of the faces might''ve served you a bit better.', '2005-09-19 09:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720509, 233115, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good contender. 7 on first pass.</td>', 'A good contender. 7 on first pass.', '2005-09-19 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720511, 232989, 15711, '<td valign="top">COol image. I like the leading line and the night time mystery of it.  I don''t even mind the figure being dead in the center, with the way that the shot is composed.</td>', 'COol image. I like the leading line and the night time mystery of it.  I don''t even mind the figure being dead in the center, with the way that the shot is composed.', '2005-09-19 09:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720512, 233341, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the angle of this shot.  The detail of the scroll work of the gate is good. The light is nice and not too harsh.</td>', 'I like the DOF and the angle of this shot.  The detail of the scroll work of the gate is good. The light is nice and not too harsh.', '2005-09-19 09:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720515, 233288, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun effect. The use of negative space is good with the figure''s placement. Not crazy about the single sat of color, although I understand its meaning. I''d like the figure to be a touch more focused. Overall - not a bad shot!</td>', 'Fun effect. The use of negative space is good with the figure''s placement. Not crazy about the single sat of color, although I understand its meaning. I''d like the figure to be a touch more focused. Overall - not a bad shot!', '2005-09-19 09:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720519, 232868, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia and candid aspect of this shot. It has sort of a snapshot at the wedding sense to it, but considering the composition and the niceness of the shot, it works pretty well. I wish her eyes were open.</td>', 'I like the sepia and candid aspect of this shot. It has sort of a snapshot at the wedding sense to it, but considering the composition and the niceness of the shot, it works pretty well. I wish her eyes were open.', '2005-09-19 09:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720520, 233049, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good creativity and imagination. 8</td>', 'Good creativity and imagination. 8', '2005-09-19 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720521, 233009, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the light streaming down on the single shrub.  The sky color is lovely.  This is great use of the rule of thirds as well.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the light streaming down on the single shrub.  The sky color is lovely.  This is great use of the rule of thirds as well.', '2005-09-19 09:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720531, 232487, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the "hippie" sense of the character.  It seems a touch out of focus though, so it loses some of it''s impact. I like the leading line and the DOF but I''d work on the sharpness a tad to really give it some punch. ;~D</td>', 'I like the "hippie" sense of the character.  It seems a touch out of focus though, so it loses some of it''s impact. I like the leading line and the DOF but I''d work on the sharpness a tad to really give it some punch. ;~D', '2005-09-19 09:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720536, 232624, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty, intense coors.  They contrast well together, the orangy yellow and blue/violet. The silhouett and reflection is spot on.</td>', 'Pretty, intense coors.  They contrast well together, the orangy yellow and blue/violet. The silhouett and reflection is spot on.', '2005-09-19 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720544, 233029, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun DOF and clear focus on the subject but I thought this was about YOUR destination. Hmmmmmm</td>', 'Fun DOF and clear focus on the subject but I thought this was about YOUR destination. Hmmmmmm', '2005-09-19 09:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720546, 233111, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent spot on portrait.  Man, the detail and clarity is really good. I like the "in your face" sense of it and the crop on the right.  Congratulations on your journey.  Best wishes too. ;~)</td>', 'Excellent spot on portrait.  Man, the detail and clarity is really good. I like the "in your face" sense of it and the crop on the right.  Congratulations on your journey.  Best wishes too. ;~)', '2005-09-19 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720547, 231684, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  The textures of the fence offsets the pasture and perfectly frames the horse nicely.</td>', 'This is a great shot!  The textures of the fence offsets the pasture and perfectly frames the horse nicely.', '2005-09-19 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720553, 232304, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The monochormatic theme works well and yellow isn''t the "expected" color. It''s like you''re sitting there but nobody can see you.  I see this hanging in a gallery with other similar abstract images.  I like this very much in all of it''s simplicity.</td>', 'I like this alot.  The monochormatic theme works well and yellow isn''t the "expected" color. It''s like you''re sitting there but nobody can see you.  I see this hanging in a gallery with other similar abstract images.  I like this very much in all of it''s simplicity.', '2005-09-19 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720555, 232905, 39664, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and tones.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Love the colors and tones.  Nice shot!', '2005-09-19 09:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720557, 233049, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The frame isn''t symmetrical which detracts from the shot. The use of negative space is good with the subject placed horizontal, so it leads your eye form corner to corner.  The lighting is good. I wish the cigarette were lit - but that might''ve created havoc on the scene. hee hee</td>', 'Interesting. The frame isn''t symmetrical which detracts from the shot. The use of negative space is good with the subject placed horizontal, so it leads your eye form corner to corner.  The lighting is good. I wish the cigarette were lit - but that might''ve created havoc on the scene. hee hee', '2005-09-19 09:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720558, 232300, 39664, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset.  Composition is a bit centered (the girl) for my tastes.  Techically sound with lovely colors.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset.  Composition is a bit centered (the girl) for my tastes.  Techically sound with lovely colors.', '2005-09-19 09:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720560, 233001, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the reflection. Good use of rule of thirds.  The overall composition is nicely done. Can I go there??</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the reflection. Good use of rule of thirds.  The overall composition is nicely done. Can I go there??', '2005-09-19 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720561, 232347, 41675, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the rushing of the water. A nice photo. It makes me want to be him.</td>', 'I can almost hear the rushing of the water. A nice photo. It makes me want to be him.', '2005-09-19 09:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720562, 233363, 39664, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  I like the framing.  Good leading lines take you to the pretty mountains and clouds.</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  I like the framing.  Good leading lines take you to the pretty mountains and clouds.', '2005-09-19 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720566, 233063, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s a nice snapshot, but I wonder how this would look taken a bit closer to the tables or maybe even a cup of coffee on one of the tables? I like the inner hairline color border.</td>', 'For me, it''s a nice snapshot, but I wonder how this would look taken a bit closer to the tables or maybe even a cup of coffee on one of the tables? I like the inner hairline color border.', '2005-09-19 09:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720568, 233341, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the black border and black gate. Good concept on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the black border and black gate. Good concept on the challenge.', '2005-09-19 09:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720571, 232055, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish the subject wasn''t dead center in the photograph, and maybe cropped a bit more from the bottom. I do like the color treatment - gives me an old world feel.</td>', 'For me, I wish the subject wasn''t dead center in the photograph, and maybe cropped a bit more from the bottom. I do like the color treatment - gives me an old world feel.', '2005-09-19 09:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720573, 231803, 39664, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea and the composition is dead on.  I think this could be improved with some subtle d&amp;b around the chin and checks so to match the nose.  Nice work!</td>', 'Beautiful idea and the composition is dead on.  I think this could be improved with some subtle d&b around the chin and checks so to match the nose.  Nice work!', '2005-09-19 09:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720575, 233133, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find the fence post a bit distracting, but I like the flower and your take on the challenge - I share your destination.</td>', 'I find the fence post a bit distracting, but I like the flower and your take on the challenge - I share your destination.', '2005-09-19 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720580, 231773, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like it...the composition and color. Nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like it...the composition and color. Nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-19 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720582, 232300, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this, but the lighting ruins it. It would be perfect with either a true silhouette in black or with the sun on her and not behind her. I love the sunset and the rich vibrant hues, but it detracts from her overall, as the red seems to be a significant part of the shot. It has definite potential - just shoot it at a different time of day. ;~)</td>', 'I love the idea of this, but the lighting ruins it. It would be perfect with either a true silhouette in black or with the sun on her and not behind her. I love the sunset and the rich vibrant hues, but it detracts from her overall, as the red seems to be a significant part of the shot. It has definite potential - just shoot it at a different time of day. ;~)', '2005-09-19 09:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720585, 232343, 41675, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge so far. Hope it does well for you. Love the powerful red car against the black and white.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge so far. Hope it does well for you. Love the powerful red car against the black and white.', '2005-09-19 09:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720586, 233304, 33535, '<td valign="top">wow that would be a goal in the old days...ok maybe now too ;D</td>', 'wow that would be a goal in the old days...ok maybe now too ;D', '2005-09-19 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720588, 233186, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and tranquility I feel when looking at this photo. Makes me want to be there :-)</td>', 'I like the simplicity and tranquility I feel when looking at this photo. Makes me want to be there :-)', '2005-09-19 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720589, 233039, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I can''t wait to find out how you did that.</td>', 'Clever.  I can''t wait to find out how you did that.', '2005-09-19 09:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720590, 233258, 41675, '<td valign="top">You have successfully given me the feel of going back in time. Well done.</td>', 'You have successfully given me the feel of going back in time. Well done.', '2005-09-19 09:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720591, 232624, 29658, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s my eye, but hte horizon seems to be not horizontal. Like the composition (in this case central is ok!) and colours.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s my eye, but hte horizon seems to be not horizontal. Like the composition (in this case central is ok!) and colours.', '2005-09-19 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720592, 233122, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, hope they find the poor pup. I like it.</td>', 'Awww, hope they find the poor pup. I like it.', '2005-09-19 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720594, 231487, 41675, '<td valign="top">Compared to other entries in the challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest even though it''s a nice tree and the colors are good.</td>', 'Compared to other entries in the challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest even though it''s a nice tree and the colors are good.', '2005-09-19 09:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720595, 232613, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  The prettiest I''ve seen as I plod through mostly mundane shots. The dim light is very pleasing and the focus is spot on. I like the perspective that the looming clouds create.</td>', 'This is lovely.  The prettiest I''ve seen as I plod through mostly mundane shots. The dim light is very pleasing and the focus is spot on. I like the perspective that the looming clouds create.', '2005-09-19 09:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720596, 231537, 29658, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the background. Love the subject.</td>', 'Don''t like the background. Love the subject.', '2005-09-19 09:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720598, 233323, 41675, '<td valign="top">At first glance I didn''t see the man in the lower left. Now that I do, he adds scale for me eyes. Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'At first glance I didn''t see the man in the lower left. Now that I do, he adds scale for me eyes. Good take on the challenge.', '2005-09-19 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720600, 233340, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the train. The leading lines is good.  I think I''d play with curves to deepen the colors just a smidge.</td>', 'I like the movement of the train. The leading lines is good.  I think I''d play with curves to deepen the colors just a smidge.', '2005-09-19 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720604, 231803, 41675, '<td valign="top">Soft and smiple...I like it.</td>', 'Soft and smiple...I like it.', '2005-09-19 10:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720605, 231951, 15711, '<td valign="top">COOL. I love the vibrant blue.  Nice perspective! I wish the leaves were dark green, but maybe the charcoal was your intent. Pretty moon for sure!!</td>', 'COOL. I love the vibrant blue.  Nice perspective! I wish the leaves were dark green, but maybe the charcoal was your intent. Pretty moon for sure!!', '2005-09-19 10:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720606, 231376, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool! One of the better moon shots I''ve seen here on DPC. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool! One of the better moon shots I''ve seen here on DPC. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-19 10:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720607, 232990, 25742, '<td valign="top">þetta er nú ábyggilega á Þingvöllum.<br/>Nice clouds and sky, but FG seems odd.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'þetta er nú ábyggilega á Þingvöllum.Nice clouds and sky, but FG seems odd.Good luck', '2005-09-19 10:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
