(1720612, 232343, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty much over the single sat, but this really works. Spot on clarity helps alot. I like the placement of the couple in the shot - like they are really going somewhere.  Good composition. I think a simple black frame would serve you well here although the lack of one isn''t a detriment. Thanks for a nice image amidst so many mundane!!!.</td>', 'I''m pretty much over the single sat, but this really works. Spot on clarity helps alot. I like the placement of the couple in the shot - like they are really going somewhere.  Good composition. I think a simple black frame would serve you well here although the lack of one isn''t a detriment. Thanks for a nice image amidst so many mundane!!!.', '2005-09-19 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720613, 232346, 25742, '<td valign="top">the guy is a little too close to the border for my taste, but other than that very good and good capture of the mood and moment.</td>', 'the guy is a little too close to the border for my taste, but other than that very good and good capture of the mood and moment.', '2005-09-19 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720614, 233360, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection.</td>', 'Interesting reflection.', '2005-09-19 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720615, 231803, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the half face of the Buddha statue.  Nice soothing blue tones. I''d like to have more light shining directly onto the statue to create more shadow.</td>', 'I like the half face of the Buddha statue.  Nice soothing blue tones. I''d like to have more light shining directly onto the statue to create more shadow.', '2005-09-19 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720617, 233300, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful light, good job in getting  the exposure just right. good luck</td>', 'beautiful light, good job in getting  the exposure just right. good luck', '2005-09-19 10:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720619, 232497, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the leading line of the bridge and the flare of the sun ehind the trees.  It does lack the color that would give it POP though. The composition is good and the use of thirds is well achieved.  I just wish it were more colored, as I can see the house is red and the green of the trees would make a nice complementary statement against the blue sky.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the leading line of the bridge and the flare of the sun ehind the trees.  It does lack the color that would give it POP though. The composition is good and the use of thirds is well achieved.  I just wish it were more colored, as I can see the house is red and the green of the trees would make a nice complementary statement against the blue sky.', '2005-09-19 10:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720623, 232994, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like this one. I''ve critique to offer other than thumbs up. Good luck</td>', 'I like this one. I''ve critique to offer other than thumbs up. Good luck', '2005-09-19 10:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
