(1721058, 232892, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would rather see a picture of the campsites and have Ausable Rier Campsite as the title.  While technically OK, there is no emotion or interest in the composition.</td>', 'I would rather see a picture of the campsites and have Ausable Rier Campsite as the title.  While technically OK, there is no emotion or interest in the composition.', '2005-09-19 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721066, 233039, 13026, '<td valign="top">This is awesome Joeeeeeyyyyy.<br/>How did you do it?  <br/>*scratches her head*<br/>This is the same place you recreated the Bliss wallpaper, isn''t it?  :)<br/>Good job!  Very nice and light and happy.</td>', 'This is awesome Joeeeeeyyyyy.How did you do it?  *scratches her head*This is the same place you recreated the Bliss wallpaper, isn''t it?  :)Good job!  Very nice and light and happy.', '2005-09-19 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721068, 232629, 6008, '<td valign="top">The scene and composition looks good but what lets it down to me is the lighting. It looks like this was taken during very bright noon/afternoon and as such looks very flat, even with the shadows on the rocks themselves. Had this been taking early morning or late evening and had more emphasis on the lighting it would have scored quite well.</td>', 'The scene and composition looks good but what lets it down to me is the lighting. It looks like this was taken during very bright noon/afternoon and as such looks very flat, even with the shadows on the rocks themselves. Had this been taking early morning or late evening and had more emphasis on the lighting it would have scored quite well.', '2005-09-19 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721075, 233104, 13026, '<td valign="top">Tilting horizon, sorry!</td>', 'Tilting horizon, sorry!', '2005-09-19 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721076, 232541, 43565, '<td valign="top">The road seems to be the focus of the picture instead of the building.  I really do not like the composition.  Maybe a different angle, or cropped closer to the entry sign.</td>', 'The road seems to be the focus of the picture instead of the building.  I really do not like the composition.  Maybe a different angle, or cropped closer to the entry sign.', '2005-09-19 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721077, 232055, 6008, '<td valign="top">I realise there is more to the scene than the tomb but it seems to be the focal point. As a focal point it is very centered, which makes the image feel very static. A different composition may have helped with the impact more. I do like the transition between dark and light and feel it adds a metaphorical something to the shot.</td>', 'I realise there is more to the scene than the tomb but it seems to be the focal point. As a focal point it is very centered, which makes the image feel very static. A different composition may have helped with the impact more. I do like the transition between dark and light and feel it adds a metaphorical something to the shot.', '2005-09-19 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721078, 232859, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I wish the photographer was a little more in focus.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I wish the photographer was a little more in focus.', '2005-09-19 13:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721082, 233367, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better without the increase in blue.</td>', 'I would like this better without the increase in blue.', '2005-09-19 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
