(1721198, 232343, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat.  The image is very crisp and fits the challenge very well.  The blurred license plate is distracting and I can''t help but wonder if there was a better way to shoot this and not give away the license plate.</td>', 'Nice selective desat.  The image is very crisp and fits the challenge very well.  The blurred license plate is distracting and I can''t help but wonder if there was a better way to shoot this and not give away the license plate.', '2005-09-19 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
