(1721249, 233303, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great image... I almost submitted something VERY similar to this so perhaps I''m a bit biased.  I love how the road seems to just go on forever and the way your model is walking down the center leads the viewer to believe that there is very little traffic.  Very desolate and emotive.... Kudos on a great shot! - 8</td>', 'Great image... I almost submitted something VERY similar to this so perhaps I''m a bit biased.  I love how the road seems to just go on forever and the way your model is walking down the center leads the viewer to believe that there is very little traffic.  Very desolate and emotive.... Kudos on a great shot! - 8', '2005-09-19 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
