(1721632, 232241, 12160, '<td valign="top">This image has lots of leading lines to enjoy. Composition is not bad and meets the challenge perfectly. I see just a little bit of sharpness a couple of doors in front of the guy but the rest are blurry. Not sure if it was due to wide open aperture, shaky hands, low ISO or low light though the station is well lit. I''ve taken subway shots and almost always I had to up the ISO for faster faster shutter and keep my hands as stable as possible. 4<br/></td>', 'This image has lots of leading lines to enjoy. Composition is not bad and meets the challenge perfectly. I see just a little bit of sharpness a couple of doors in front of the guy but the rest are blurry. Not sure if it was due to wide open aperture, shaky hands, low ISO or low light though the station is well lit. I''ve taken subway shots and almost always I had to up the ISO for faster faster shutter and keep my hands as stable as possible. 4', '2005-09-19 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
