(1721843, 233341, 40181, '<td valign="top">I was thinking about doing a graveyard shot for this as well but I didn''t have the time.  <br/> <br/>The shot is pretty decent but the border is too large for my taste.  Also, it might look better in black and white or at night when the colors are duller. When I think of cemetaries I think dark and moody, and I''m not sure if this image has the right mood.  Also, maybe try a different perspective; it looks a little awkward for some reason (maybe its just me).<br/> <br/>Hope my comment was helpful =D</td>', 'I was thinking about doing a graveyard shot for this as well but I didn''t have the time.   The shot is pretty decent but the border is too large for my taste.  Also, it might look better in black and white or at night when the colors are duller. When I think of cemetaries I think dark and moody, and I''m not sure if this image has the right mood.  Also, maybe try a different perspective; it looks a little awkward for some reason (maybe its just me). Hope my comment was helpful =D', '2005-09-19 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
