(1721845, 233370, 35517, '<td valign="top">sheer brillliance... im sure some will complain about how dark it is... but to me i love it, it makes the story so much more mysterious.. and maybe dreamlike..... congrats... 10 from me... i hope this ribbons....</td>', 'sheer brillliance... im sure some will complain about how dark it is... but to me i love it, it makes the story so much more mysterious.. and maybe dreamlike..... congrats... 10 from me... i hope this ribbons....', '2005-09-19 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
