(1722857, 233303, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the blackened  sense of the colors - except for an almost silvery road. This has an illusional quality for me. It''s simple yet it evokes great emotion. You just figure she''ll walk off until you can''t see her any more and then you''ll wonder where she went.</td>', 'I like the blackened  sense of the colors - except for an almost silvery road. This has an illusional quality for me. It''s simple yet it evokes great emotion. You just figure she''ll walk off until you can''t see her any more and then you''ll wonder where she went.', '2005-09-20 00:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722871, 232909, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent architectural shot.  I like the circular dome being "cut" by the horizontal piece in the bottom right corner. The brown and blue tones are perfectly matched contrastingly!   This is going to sound totally nit picky, but I hate it when the name of the challenge is in the title.  I''d rather it be named "TOP."  Ok, slap me.  I love this image !  9</td>', 'This is an excellent architectural shot.  I like the circular dome being "cut" by the horizontal piece in the bottom right corner. The brown and blue tones are perfectly matched contrastingly!   This is going to sound totally nit picky, but I hate it when the name of the challenge is in the title.  I''d rather it be named "TOP."  Ok, slap me.  I love this image !  9', '2005-09-20 00:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722877, 231566, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I really like this shot.  The guy has an inquisitive expression like he is really wanting to learn. His placement in the shot is interesting with good use of the negative space on the lef and above his headt. The colors are realistic and not overblown. Overall -a nice shot for sure. 8</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I really like this shot.  The guy has an inquisitive expression like he is really wanting to learn. His placement in the shot is interesting with good use of the negative space on the lef and above his headt. The colors are realistic and not overblown. Overall -a nice shot for sure. 8', '2005-09-20 00:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722880, 233106, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like your perspective and the way you cropped it.  The water under the plane is a great reflective addition to the shot.  Very detailed and the contrast is great.  The choice of the black and white filter really breaks down the variations and tones of the shot. Good job.</td>', 'I like your perspective and the way you cropped it.  The water under the plane is a great reflective addition to the shot.  Very detailed and the contrast is great.  The choice of the black and white filter really breaks down the variations and tones of the shot. Good job.', '2005-09-20 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722881, 232955, 33145, '<td valign="top">intentionally blurry???</td>', 'intentionally blurry???', '2005-09-20 00:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722889, 232802, 15711, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like the staged type shot, but for some reason, this one really works for me. It sounds weird, but I think it''s the linear quality of the striped tie.  I love the gray, blac and blue of it. And it''s so detailed that the shine looks just like it''s off of the shelf at the department store.  You know how you look at something and think you see something else?  I''m laughing, cause I thought at first it said "Welcome to the Supernatural Society Pension Plan! "  LOL  I was trying to figure that one out.  I get it now. ha ha ha ha Fun and different capture. 8</td>', 'I usually don''t like the staged type shot, but for some reason, this one really works for me. It sounds weird, but I think it''s the linear quality of the striped tie.  I love the gray, blac and blue of it. And it''s so detailed that the shine looks just like it''s off of the shelf at the department store.  You know how you look at something and think you see something else?  I''m laughing, cause I thought at first it said "Welcome to the Supernatural Society Pension Plan! "  LOL  I was trying to figure that one out.  I get it now. ha ha ha ha Fun and different capture. 8', '2005-09-20 00:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1722894, 233095, 15711, '<td valign="top">You can''t hardly go wrong with a guy with great pecs!!!  I dont think it would be nearly as effective if you hadn''t chosen to use the natural coloration either. I like the warm skin tones and the red, white and blue of the shorts. (don''t put the challenge name in the title -ok, my only gripe) ;~p</td>', 'You can''t hardly go wrong with a guy with great pecs!!!  I dont think it would be nearly as effective if you hadn''t chosen to use the natural coloration either. I like the warm skin tones and the red, white and blue of the shorts. (don''t put the challenge name in the title -ok, my only gripe) ;~p', '2005-09-20 00:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
