(1723439, 232052, 1563, '<td valign="top">this picture would have scored higher if it had a lighter foreground and showing your daughter more clearly</td>', 'this picture would have scored higher if it had a lighter foreground and showing your daughter more clearly', '2005-09-20 07:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723445, 233107, 7304, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors. Not sure where the main focus is because they are all fighting for equal attention.</td>', 'Vibrant colors. Not sure where the main focus is because they are all fighting for equal attention.', '2005-09-20 07:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723446, 233095, 1563, '<td valign="top">Good structure, good picture, title expresses the goal.  I would have loved a womans body but you still get 9</td>', 'Good structure, good picture, title expresses the goal.  I would have loved a womans body but you still get 9', '2005-09-20 07:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723451, 232859, 1563, '<td valign="top">He seems more to be slouching but nice setup.</td>', 'He seems more to be slouching but nice setup.', '2005-09-20 07:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723452, 232990, 1563, '<td valign="top">Go Iceland,</td>', 'Go Iceland,', '2005-09-20 07:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723454, 231951, 1563, '<td valign="top">You could have done a better job in framing, but ok picture still</td>', 'You could have done a better job in framing, but ok picture still', '2005-09-20 07:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723461, 230935, 1563, '<td valign="top">The pink frame killed it for me.</td>', 'The pink frame killed it for me.', '2005-09-20 07:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723470, 232955, 1563, '<td valign="top">Far too blurry, misses its shot<br/></td>', 'Far too blurry, misses its shot', '2005-09-20 07:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723473, 232430, 41437, '<td valign="top">Very well done</td>', 'Very well done', '2005-09-20 07:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723517, 233096, 3569, '<td valign="top">sky a bit too grainy, subject nice though</td>', 'sky a bit too grainy, subject nice though', '2005-09-20 08:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723518, 233303, 3569, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this on verticle, maybe better.</td>', 'I''d like to see this on verticle, maybe better.', '2005-09-20 08:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723523, 231803, 797, '<td valign="top">This is by far the most gripping photo of all here. Draws you to want the solitude and inner peace the face portrays.</td>', 'This is by far the most gripping photo of all here. Draws you to want the solitude and inner peace the face portrays.', '2005-09-20 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723532, 233039, 21714, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge. It''s not a beautiful landscape. Read challenge details. Again. :)</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge. It''s not a beautiful landscape. Read challenge details. Again. :)', '2005-09-20 09:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723553, 232343, 23456, '<td valign="top">Wow ! I really like this a lot , it has so much character and the selective desat works to its advantage. Except for the branch detracting and also the smudge on the number plate, this shot is perfect. Clone them out and this is one for the wall ! Well done !</td>', 'Wow ! I really like this a lot , it has so much character and the selective desat works to its advantage. Except for the branch detracting and also the smudge on the number plate, this shot is perfect. Clone them out and this is one for the wall ! Well done !', '2005-09-20 09:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723568, 231360, 37375, '<td valign="top">Like all art it takes immagination and composing to send a message</td>', 'Like all art it takes immagination and composing to send a message', '2005-09-20 09:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723598, 233344, 34192, '<td valign="top">Destination?  Yes.  Color well done? Yes.  Composition?  Well, honestly, its a little boring.  As a conceptual piece it works, much like modern art, but as a photograph it doesn''t hold my attention for long.  I really like the lighting effect you acheived.  Also enjoy the fade to black. 7 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Destination?  Yes.  Color well done? Yes.  Composition?  Well, honestly, its a little boring.  As a conceptual piece it works, much like modern art, but as a photograph it doesn''t hold my attention for long.  I really like the lighting effect you acheived.  Also enjoy the fade to black. 7 - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-20 10:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723602, 232296, 34192, '<td valign="top">Color, composition, crop all good.  Fits challenge.  Lighting works. 7</td>', 'Color, composition, crop all good.  Fits challenge.  Lighting works. 7', '2005-09-20 10:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723605, 233349, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and very interesting composition.  Most people would give a crapload of sky.  Think this works infinitely better.  Centered works for me as well. 7</td>', 'Interesting lighting and very interesting composition.  Most people would give a crapload of sky.  Think this works infinitely better.  Centered works for me as well. 7', '2005-09-20 10:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723608, 233300, 42602, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot! Give yourself a pat on the back for this one: the lighting is beautiful!</td>', 'Incredible shot! Give yourself a pat on the back for this one: the lighting is beautiful!', '2005-09-20 10:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723610, 233105, 34192, '<td valign="top">The background looks wavy like a reflection but I have no reference to show me that''s what I''m looking at.  The end result is that I am uncomfortable viewing the image.  The title seems to make me want to be comfortable so it conflicts with the uncertainty of the image.</td>', 'The background looks wavy like a reflection but I have no reference to show me that''s what I''m looking at.  The end result is that I am uncomfortable viewing the image.  The title seems to make me want to be comfortable so it conflicts with the uncertainty of the image.', '2005-09-20 10:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723611, 233237, 34192, '<td valign="top">very pretty.  excellent lighting, good composition, tones work well. 7</td>', 'very pretty.  excellent lighting, good composition, tones work well. 7', '2005-09-20 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723615, 233377, 34192, '<td valign="top">A little too close for me to instantly recognize what is going on here.  Just slighly backed away may suit the image better.  Everthing is wrapped around the center of the image but the center is a flat map with very little to hold its important position.  Colors and focus well done.  DOF good. 6</td>', 'A little too close for me to instantly recognize what is going on here.  Just slighly backed away may suit the image better.  Everthing is wrapped around the center of the image but the center is a flat map with very little to hold its important position.  Colors and focus well done.  DOF good. 6', '2005-09-20 10:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723621, 232718, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but at the same time something looks off.  This image has a very 2 dimensional feel to it which conflicts with my belief that I want three dimensions.  The back cliff seems to be resting on  top of the front cliff rather than taking up space behind it.  This  give the sea a bizarre appearance in that it is flat and not flat at the same time.  The colors are good as is the DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful, but at the same time something looks off.  This image has a very 2 dimensional feel to it which conflicts with my belief that I want three dimensions.  The back cliff seems to be resting on  top of the front cliff rather than taking up space behind it.  This  give the sea a bizarre appearance in that it is flat and not flat at the same time.  The colors are good as is the DOF.', '2005-09-20 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1723625, 233367, 34192, '<td valign="top">When I think of wild blue yonder I think of unlimited space.  Your image fights against that by being confined in depth.  I really don''t get a sense of space here.  I love the colors.  The composition is okay - it''s very top weighted which increases the perception (for me) of confinement. I think, if you turned this image upside down, it may free it up somewhat. 6</td>', 'When I think of wild blue yonder I think of unlimited space.  Your image fights against that by being confined in depth.  I really don''t get a sense of space here.  I love the colors.  The composition is okay - it''s very top weighted which increases the perception (for me) of confinement. I think, if you turned this image upside down, it may free it up somewhat. 6', '2005-09-20 10:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723631, 232287, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Amazing capture.  I know this is not that spectacular to many people but I believe this is one of those once in a great while moments that came together perfectly for you.  The timing is impeccable.  Because it is not bright and shiny it may not do well in the challenge but the image itself is... okay , I''m at a loss for words. 10. You deserve more but thats what I got.</td>', 'Wow.  Amazing capture.  I know this is not that spectacular to many people but I believe this is one of those once in a great while moments that came together perfectly for you.  The timing is impeccable.  Because it is not bright and shiny it may not do well in the challenge but the image itself is... okay , I''m at a loss for words. 10. You deserve more but thats what I got.', '2005-09-20 10:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723634, 233321, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like that you included the crowd for reference.  Colors are well rendered.  Composition, POV, DOF, well done. 7</td>', 'I like that you included the crowd for reference.  Colors are well rendered.  Composition, POV, DOF, well done. 7', '2005-09-20 10:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723635, 233350, 34192, '<td valign="top">I would believe the title if the tower wasn''t there.  Man always finds a way to ruin the most beautiful places. :)  Lighting, DOF, POV all excellent.  Colors a little washed but I beleive it works with the image of restful retirement. 7</td>', 'I would believe the title if the tower wasn''t there.  Man always finds a way to ruin the most beautiful places. :)  Lighting, DOF, POV all excellent.  Colors a little washed but I beleive it works with the image of restful retirement. 7', '2005-09-20 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723644, 232908, 34192, '<td valign="top">The location is beautiful but the image is just enough out of focus (or blurred) to make it uncomfortable to look at.  The white rocks are brighter than the water, drawing my eye and demanding my attention.  This detracts from the image.  Like the blur in the water. 5</td>', 'The location is beautiful but the image is just enough out of focus (or blurred) to make it uncomfortable to look at.  The white rocks are brighter than the water, drawing my eye and demanding my attention.  This detracts from the image.  Like the blur in the water. 5', '2005-09-20 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723646, 233029, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  First impression - I want to vomit.  Sorry - weak stomach.  Centered composition works here.  Her arms seem unnaturally elongated.  Lighting good.  Must have been a blast editing this. ;)  Love the shadow of her legs - adds depth. 7</td>', 'Wow.  First impression - I want to vomit.  Sorry - weak stomach.  Centered composition works here.  Her arms seem unnaturally elongated.  Lighting good.  Must have been a blast editing this. ;)  Love the shadow of her legs - adds depth. 7', '2005-09-20 10:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723650, 233338, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Another postcard picture of the bridge.  This should do well in the challenge.  Photographically it is good.  Seems a little oversatuated and sharpened on the rocks/ground on the right side.  May be due to light.  The lighting doesn''t really match the sky.  Composition and POV good. 7</td>', 'Hmmm.  Another postcard picture of the bridge.  This should do well in the challenge.  Photographically it is good.  Seems a little oversatuated and sharpened on the rocks/ground on the right side.  May be due to light.  The lighting doesn''t really match the sky.  Composition and POV good. 7', '2005-09-20 10:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723653, 233106, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  Excellent lighting.  Excellent tones.  POV, DOF, perfect.  Not one for airplane images but this is probably the best one I''ve seen on DPC. 10</td>', 'Excellent composition.  Excellent lighting.  Excellent tones.  POV, DOF, perfect.  Not one for airplane images but this is probably the best one I''ve seen on DPC. 10', '2005-09-20 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723672, 233318, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice.  The map is a little outside the DOF and the lighting is a little dark, but the image works. 5</td>', 'Interesting choice.  The map is a little outside the DOF and the lighting is a little dark, but the image works. 5', '2005-09-20 10:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723678, 231513, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like the inclusion of people especially part of the way through a leading line.  Wish the one wasn''t wearing red - it pulls my eye right there - maybe later you can color shift it to go woth the beautiful blues/greens/yellows?  Light excellent.  POV excellent.  I looked at this image a full 5 minutes before noticing the fence on the left - very effective camouflage - you found the exact right place to take this image.  Maybe clone out the car at the very back right.  The details in the trunks are amazing.  Like the tree used as frame on the right, the sidewalk crop tot he corner works well. Maybe a tree on the left for another border?  9 - may bump later</td>', 'Like the inclusion of people especially part of the way through a leading line.  Wish the one wasn''t wearing red - it pulls my eye right there - maybe later you can color shift it to go woth the beautiful blues/greens/yellows?  Light excellent.  POV excellent.  I looked at this image a full 5 minutes before noticing the fence on the left - very effective camouflage - you found the exact right place to take this image.  Maybe clone out the car at the very back right.  The details in the trunks are amazing.  Like the tree used as frame on the right, the sidewalk crop tot he corner works well. Maybe a tree on the left for another border?  9 - may bump later', '2005-09-20 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723681, 232245, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  Think the image is well done for subject.  POV, DOF, composition excellent.  Maybe a slight bump in contrast but otherwise, excellent job. 8</td>', 'Like the idea.  Think the image is well done for subject.  POV, DOF, composition excellent.  Maybe a slight bump in contrast but otherwise, excellent job. 8', '2005-09-20 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723687, 233098, 34192, '<td valign="top">Composition and POV well done.  Lighting a little harsh and DOF a little short - the board/writing in the back should be in focus.</td>', 'Composition and POV well done.  Lighting a little harsh and DOF a little short - the board/writing in the back should be in focus.', '2005-09-20 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723691, 233032, 34192, '<td valign="top">Nice fog! :)  I like this image but I think it could do with a slight contrast bump OR a little lightening of the space around the man and his boat to make them really pop.  Composition excellent.  DOF, POV very well done. 8</td>', 'Nice fog! :)  I like this image but I think it could do with a slight contrast bump OR a little lightening of the space around the man and his boat to make them really pop.  Composition excellent.  DOF, POV very well done. 8', '2005-09-20 10:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723696, 231935, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s really bright.  A lot going on with no central place to rest my eyes.  I don''t know what I should be looking at - strange juxtaposition. 6</td>', 'Wow.  That''s really bright.  A lot going on with no central place to rest my eyes.  I don''t know what I should be looking at - strange juxtaposition. 6', '2005-09-20 10:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723705, 232859, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''m left wondering why you cropped it the way you did.  I would have put him lower in the frame to capture more space above.  This is because his camera/scope is looking up - it leads my eye right out of the frame.  Nothing is added by the lower half of the image.  DOF is excellent, tones rendered well. 6</td>', 'Interesting.  I''m left wondering why you cropped it the way you did.  I would have put him lower in the frame to capture more space above.  This is because his camera/scope is looking up - it leads my eye right out of the frame.  Nothing is added by the lower half of the image.  DOF is excellent, tones rendered well. 6', '2005-09-20 10:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1723708, 232015, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  However, you do have excellent lighting and the tones are well rendered.  I like the composition and the balance. 6</td>', 'I don''t get it.  However, you do have excellent lighting and the tones are well rendered.  I like the composition and the balance. 6', '2005-09-20 11:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
