(1723765, 232613, 34192, '<td valign="top">Lighting here is fascinating and love the tones used.  Frame works to contain image.  Like the composition.  Wonder if the contrast could be bumped just a hair more.  7</td>', 'Lighting here is fascinating and love the tones used.  Frame works to contain image.  Like the composition.  Wonder if the contrast could be bumped just a hair more.  7', '2005-09-20 11:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
