(1724272, 232718, 208, '<td valign="top">As gorgeous as this is, it just looks really fake, almost as though it''s three separate photos put together. Maybe it''s the sky, which looks great; or the sharpness of the cliffs, which are cool; or the very green pathway; probably the combination of all three. I''m sure it''s real, but I think maybe it''s just overprocessed for my tastes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-26 10:04:17.</i></td>', 'As gorgeous as this is, it just looks really fake, almost as though it''s three separate photos put together. Maybe it''s the sky, which looks great; or the sharpness of the cliffs, which are cool; or the very green pathway; probably the combination of all three. I''m sure it''s real, but I think maybe it''s just overprocessed for my tastes.', '2005-09-20 15:06:15.000000', '2005-09-26 11:04:17.000000', 1),
(1724273, 233239, 36981, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  This is so very well done, and I can''t imagine but that it must have been difficult to time it all so perfectly.  It''s a beautiful and moving image.</td>', 'Fabulous.  This is so very well done, and I can''t imagine but that it must have been difficult to time it all so perfectly.  It''s a beautiful and moving image.', '2005-09-20 15:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724289, 232525, 208, '<td valign="top">There''s an element missing from this photo that would make it more interesting. A person watching the tram go by, or a *something* that it''s heading toward. While the picture is well focused with nice colors, there''s nothing to draw me into the frame.</td>', 'There''s an element missing from this photo that would make it more interesting. A person watching the tram go by, or a *something* that it''s heading toward. While the picture is well focused with nice colors, there''s nothing to draw me into the frame.', '2005-09-20 15:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724296, 233321, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very sharp shot.  They all look like they''ve been freezed frame tho''.  Is that what you intended?</td>', 'Very sharp shot.  They all look like they''ve been freezed frame tho''.  Is that what you intended?', '2005-09-20 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724300, 231867, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the ray of light, but so much of the shot looks dirty. The bird might pop more if the picture were brighter.</td>', 'I like the ray of light, but so much of the shot looks dirty. The bird might pop more if the picture were brighter.', '2005-09-20 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724363, 231690, 26255, '<td valign="top">I understand what you''re going for here, but the image alone shows a disturbing separation to me.  The fact that you used a male and a female of approximately the same age could indicate a couple.  The separation of the wall brings a general coldness to the image IMHO and taken without the title shows a "destination" quite different from what your intent was.  The cropping also seems a little awkward and my focus keeps shifting to the light switch.  I think the choice of black and white is a good one, but it further adds to the "cold" feeling I get from the image.  I think that with a different title, the statement made by this image could have much more impact.</td>', 'I understand what you''re going for here, but the image alone shows a disturbing separation to me.  The fact that you used a male and a female of approximately the same age could indicate a couple.  The separation of the wall brings a general coldness to the image IMHO and taken without the title shows a "destination" quite different from what your intent was.  The cropping also seems a little awkward and my focus keeps shifting to the light switch.  I think the choice of black and white is a good one, but it further adds to the "cold" feeling I get from the image.  I think that with a different title, the statement made by this image could have much more impact.', '2005-09-20 15:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724365, 232952, 25754, '<td valign="top">wow, that looks like alot of money to me :)<br/>it''s an interesting idea but not very aesthetically pleasing. A different composition would have helped. Lighting is a bit flat as well.</td>', 'wow, that looks like alot of money to me :)it''s an interesting idea but not very aesthetically pleasing. A different composition would have helped. Lighting is a bit flat as well.', '2005-09-20 15:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
