(1724691, 232295, 4281, '<td valign="top">The first thing that popped into my mind when looking at this photo was "what''s the destination?" Is it the Moon or the nice countryside?<br/>I then looked at the title and noticed you are referring to the Moon. What I''m basically trying to say here is that the foreground doesn''t serve any purpose in this image except being pretty to look at. If the foreground had been a road or a river or something to serve as a "route" to the destination in the picture or if you had included a person looking at the moon it would have been a much better photograph in my opinion.</td>', 'The first thing that popped into my mind when looking at this photo was "what''s the destination?" Is it the Moon or the nice countryside?I then looked at the title and noticed you are referring to the Moon. What I''m basically trying to say here is that the foreground doesn''t serve any purpose in this image except being pretty to look at. If the foreground had been a road or a river or something to serve as a "route" to the destination in the picture or if you had included a person looking at the moon it would have been a much better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-09-20 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724699, 232039, 4281, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit dark, it took me few seconds to notice that this is a cemetery. A longer exposure would probably have been what the doctor ordered ... or perhaps you should have photographed this during the day? What purpose does it serve to take the photo during the night? If the purpose was to include those streetlights I must say I don''t particularly like them in the photo.<br/>The idea though is nice - I just think the implementation could have been better.</td>', 'It''s a bit dark, it took me few seconds to notice that this is a cemetery. A longer exposure would probably have been what the doctor ordered ... or perhaps you should have photographed this during the day? What purpose does it serve to take the photo during the night? If the purpose was to include those streetlights I must say I don''t particularly like them in the photo.The idea though is nice - I just think the implementation could have been better.', '2005-09-20 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724704, 233120, 4281, '<td valign="top">Frankly, I''m baffled by this image. Yes, the fishing-pole is fun and the forest and the reflection in the lake are very pretty but what purpose does that pole beside the fishing-pole serve? I just don''t get it. <br/>It''s not much of a destination picture either in my opinion.</td>', 'Frankly, I''m baffled by this image. Yes, the fishing-pole is fun and the forest and the reflection in the lake are very pretty but what purpose does that pole beside the fishing-pole serve? I just don''t get it. It''s not much of a destination picture either in my opinion.', '2005-09-20 18:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724709, 233366, 4281, '<td valign="top">Yes, they have a goal but do they have a common destination? <br/>The guy to the right is funny but I don''t like how the photograph cuts acroos the leg and the hand of the frontmost guy in the line. You should have backed away slightly to be able to include him in the picture.</td>', 'Yes, they have a goal but do they have a common destination? The guy to the right is funny but I don''t like how the photograph cuts acroos the leg and the hand of the frontmost guy in the line. You should have backed away slightly to be able to include him in the picture.', '2005-09-20 18:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724716, 233186, 4281, '<td valign="top">A quite beautiful picture. The horizon doesn''t seem to be level though and I don''t connect this picture with a destination, even though you''ve titled the photograph "Tennessee".</td>', 'A quite beautiful picture. The horizon doesn''t seem to be level though and I don''t connect this picture with a destination, even though you''ve titled the photograph "Tennessee".', '2005-09-20 18:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724735, 232908, 4281, '<td valign="top">Nope, doesn''t work for me. I just don''t like the bricks or the stone to the right of the waterfall. At least you should have darkened them a bit.<br/>But it''s the composition I find most lacking here. It''s just not interesting enough. It seems, for example, that you didn''t include the entire waterfall in the image (the leftmost part is missing) and a foreground is sorely lacking here. Perhaps if you had gone slightly more to the right and positioned the camera a bit lower, using the stone in the bottom right corner as some kind of foreground. A vertical composition might also have worked better here, perhaps following the small stream to the waterfall?</td>', 'Nope, doesn''t work for me. I just don''t like the bricks or the stone to the right of the waterfall. At least you should have darkened them a bit.But it''s the composition I find most lacking here. It''s just not interesting enough. It seems, for example, that you didn''t include the entire waterfall in the image (the leftmost part is missing) and a foreground is sorely lacking here. Perhaps if you had gone slightly more to the right and positioned the camera a bit lower, using the stone in the bottom right corner as some kind of foreground. A vertical composition might also have worked better here, perhaps following the small stream to the waterfall?', '2005-09-20 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724739, 233360, 4281, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun reflection but I don''t get it, even after reading the title,  how this picture is supposed to be connected with the word ''destination''.</td>', 'It''s a fun reflection but I don''t get it, even after reading the title,  how this picture is supposed to be connected with the word ''destination''.', '2005-09-20 18:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724748, 233338, 4281, '<td valign="top">Is it? Isn''t the other side also populated by humans? :S<br/>Well, other than that it''s kinda nice photograph of a much-photographed bridge. However, I think you should have pointed the camera slightly more to the left - the distant part of the bridge really needs some space to the left and I think you have included a bit too much space on the right side. <br/>Better in high-contrast B&amp;W perhaps?</td>', 'Is it? Isn''t the other side also populated by humans? :SWell, other than that it''s kinda nice photograph of a much-photographed bridge. However, I think you should have pointed the camera slightly more to the left - the distant part of the bridge really needs some space to the left and I think you have included a bit too much space on the right side. Better in high-contrast B&W perhaps?', '2005-09-20 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1724755, 233049, 4281, '<td valign="top">I really like this one - quite creative and I hope you''ll do well.<br/> <br/>What''s with the black border at the bottom anyway?</td>', 'I really like this one - quite creative and I hope you''ll do well. What''s with the black border at the bottom anyway?', '2005-09-20 18:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
