(1724869, 231360, 4281, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, could this be on a golf course? By Elapso even? :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a splendid idea and the resulting image sure is nice to look at. <br/>What''s with the black umbrella and T-shirt? Are you referring to the ''Unknown'' in the title?<br/>It''s just that I think it would have been nice to have a slight Mary-Poppins element in this with a colorful umbrella and clothing.<br/> <br/>Still, it''s quite nice image as it is and wonderful image-processing. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Hehehe, could this be on a golf course? By Elapso even? :) Anyway, it''s a splendid idea and the resulting image sure is nice to look at. What''s with the black umbrella and T-shirt? Are you referring to the ''Unknown'' in the title?It''s just that I think it would have been nice to have a slight Mary-Poppins element in this with a colorful umbrella and clothing. Still, it''s quite nice image as it is and wonderful image-processing. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-20 19:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
