(1725239, 232629, 44446, '<td valign="top">I can''t think of another place that one can''t feel the peace and tranquility that this scene brings to me.  The bold, yet warm colors against the blue sky take my breath away.  This should get a vote of the highest.  I''ve never before seen a photo from here on the water''s edge.</td>', 'I can''t think of another place that one can''t feel the peace and tranquility that this scene brings to me.  The bold, yet warm colors against the blue sky take my breath away.  This should get a vote of the highest.  I''ve never before seen a photo from here on the water''s edge.', '2005-09-20 21:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725274, 233039, 19474, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to work out if you used cables to hold the ladder and cloned them out or you have some sort of frame hidden just behind the rise... I think the second option ?<br/>the shot has good colors and lighting, but the shot dose not seem balanced to me<br/>maybe moving the space from the bottom and right to the top and left would have helped so it would look like you were climbing more into space  - 7</td>', 'I''m trying to work out if you used cables to hold the ladder and cloned them out or you have some sort of frame hidden just behind the rise... I think the second option ?the shot has good colors and lighting, but the shot dose not seem balanced to memaybe moving the space from the bottom and right to the top and left would have helped so it would look like you were climbing more into space  - 7', '2005-09-20 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
