(1725324, 232343, 2333, '<td valign="top">I love the editing work,  specifically the vignetting and the selective softening. I love the way the cans add the feel of motion, you having caught a few in mid-bounce. <br/>I am having trouble wit the purpose behind the selective desat... it seems to bring attention to the car, and take attention away from the bride &amp; groom, the real subjects.</td>', 'I love the editing work,  specifically the vignetting and the selective softening. I love the way the cans add the feel of motion, you having caught a few in mid-bounce. I am having trouble wit the purpose behind the selective desat... it seems to bring attention to the car, and take attention away from the bride & groom, the real subjects.', '2005-09-20 21:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725352, 233239, 2333, '<td valign="top">Like the symmetry, and the title is well crafted, really adds to the mood. But Daniel, your "mug" is getting too recognizable, LOL!</td>', 'Like the symmetry, and the title is well crafted, really adds to the mood. But Daniel, your "mug" is getting too recognizable, LOL!', '2005-09-20 22:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725356, 233305, 35602, '<td valign="top">Colors need to be more contrasty and saturated.  Also, it is  best not to divide a composition in half, as was done here.  A lower angle to get more of the field or higher to get more of the church might have kept that cut in half look away.</td>', 'Colors need to be more contrasty and saturated.  Also, it is  best not to divide a composition in half, as was done here.  A lower angle to get more of the field or higher to get more of the church might have kept that cut in half look away.', '2005-09-20 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725361, 232955, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too much blur.  If you were trying to depict motion, it is always a good idea to have some part of the image sharper.</td>', 'Too much blur.  If you were trying to depict motion, it is always a good idea to have some part of the image sharper.', '2005-09-20 22:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725369, 232591, 35602, '<td valign="top">I immediately noticed the white area near the bottom.  It should have been cropped out.  One of those details that you have to be aware of.  I did like the tonal treatment you did on the image, and the detail of the stone is really nice.</td>', 'I immediately noticed the white area near the bottom.  It should have been cropped out.  One of those details that you have to be aware of.  I did like the tonal treatment you did on the image, and the detail of the stone is really nice.', '2005-09-20 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725373, 231241, 35602, '<td valign="top">Loved the contrasts and highlights on the wood desk.  The image was nicely done.</td>', 'Loved the contrasts and highlights on the wood desk.  The image was nicely done.', '2005-09-20 22:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725378, 233084, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The contrast between the bright sail of the boat and the fog around the bridge makes this one a wonderful image.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The contrast between the bright sail of the boat and the fog around the bridge makes this one a wonderful image.', '2005-09-20 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725418, 233243, 2333, '<td valign="top">Although the coors are a bit "over the top" here, it just... works, fo rthis shot. I very much like the composition as well. One of my favorites for this challenge. Nice work.</td>', 'Although the coors are a bit "over the top" here, it just... works, fo rthis shot. I very much like the composition as well. One of my favorites for this challenge. Nice work.', '2005-09-20 22:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725424, 233106, 2333, '<td valign="top">Well seem! Everything works here. Very nice tonal range, the high contrast adds to the dark, forboding mood, and emphasizes the inhuman nature of the raw technology. Your formating of the title is a nice touch as well. I really can''t find much room for improvement, except possibly burning the interior of the hangar to reduce the (slight) distraction of what appears inside.</td>', 'Well seem! Everything works here. Very nice tonal range, the high contrast adds to the dark, forboding mood, and emphasizes the inhuman nature of the raw technology. Your formating of the title is a nice touch as well. I really can''t find much room for improvement, except possibly burning the interior of the hangar to reduce the (slight) distraction of what appears inside.', '2005-09-20 22:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725426, 232003, 2333, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean, elegant. Well concieved, well executed. Like the title.</td>', 'Simple, clean, elegant. Well concieved, well executed. Like the title.', '2005-09-20 22:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725430, 232868, 2333, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, touching moment captured. Nice work on the sepia toning, I''d only wissh for must a little more detail in his jacket, but that''s a very small niggle.</td>', 'A beautiful, touching moment captured. Nice work on the sepia toning, I''d only wissh for must a little more detail in his jacket, but that''s a very small niggle.', '2005-09-20 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725438, 233288, 2333, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and the color left on the wine. It''''s one of the few selective desats that seems to have a purpose in the effect. <br/>One small detreaction, IMO is the very apparent source and motion of the fog; it would be better, IMO, if the fog were in slower motion and with a less well-difined source.</td>', 'I like the concept, and the color left on the wine. It''''s one of the few selective desats that seems to have a purpose in the effect. One small detreaction, IMO is the very apparent source and motion of the fog; it would be better, IMO, if the fog were in slower motion and with a less well-difined source.', '2005-09-20 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725454, 232430, 2333, '<td valign="top">A nice capture... the saturation is just too much for me though. IMO this would have done better with significantly less oversaturation.</td>', 'A nice capture... the saturation is just too much for me though. IMO this would have done better with significantly less oversaturation.', '2005-09-20 22:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725472, 231690, 2333, '<td valign="top">I like the basic idea... the distortion and tilt of the door frame detracts for me. The light switch doesn''t seem to be adding anything, I wonder if hooting from  bit higher could have eliminated it?</td>', 'I like the basic idea... the distortion and tilt of the door frame detracts for me. The light switch doesn''t seem to be adding anything, I wonder if hooting from  bit higher could have eliminated it?', '2005-09-20 22:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725486, 231087, 2333, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and the editing basically works, even though I''m sure it looks nothing like the original in mood!<br/>I did take one point off for the fiarly apparent halo around the building where burning on the sky fades out.</td>', 'I like the concept, and the editing basically works, even though I''m sure it looks nothing like the original in mood!I did take one point off for the fiarly apparent halo around the building where burning on the sky fades out.', '2005-09-20 22:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725494, 232844, 2333, '<td valign="top">I know the boat is technically your subject, and is in focus, however I feel the BG lights in this case need to be in focus as well. A smaller aperture and/or slightly different focus point would have helped immensely I think.</td>', 'I know the boat is technically your subject, and is in focus, however I feel the BG lights in this case need to be in focus as well. A smaller aperture and/or slightly different focus point would have helped immensely I think.', '2005-09-20 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
