(1725816, 232988, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice choice to use black and white.  I wish there was more of a central focus point.  My eye roams around the frame, but doesn''t really stay long anywhere.  The cloud looks beautiful, great exposure and detail.</td>', 'Nice choice to use black and white.  I wish there was more of a central focus point.  My eye roams around the frame, but doesn''t really stay long anywhere.  The cloud looks beautiful, great exposure and detail.', '2005-09-21 00:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725819, 232548, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find that black border distracting. I wonder what it would look like if you chose a blue hue from the background? I like the concept though</td>', 'I find that black border distracting. I wonder what it would look like if you chose a blue hue from the background? I like the concept though', '2005-09-21 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725829, 233367, 41675, '<td valign="top">It might be my monitor, but the water seems overly green although your title says blue yonder. I wonder how this would look if the leaf was off-centered? I like the leaf shadow in the water :)</td>', 'It might be my monitor, but the water seems overly green although your title says blue yonder. I wonder how this would look if the leaf was off-centered? I like the leaf shadow in the water :)', '2005-09-21 00:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725833, 233049, 37103, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea.  I love the juxtaposition of the flower and the cigarette.  I''m not crazy about the gray background, but it works well with the idea of ashes and death.  I can tell the flower is fake, which bothers me a little, but the overall effect is wonderful.</td>', 'Fabulous idea.  I love the juxtaposition of the flower and the cigarette.  I''m not crazy about the gray background, but it works well with the idea of ashes and death.  I can tell the flower is fake, which bothers me a little, but the overall effect is wonderful.', '2005-09-21 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725835, 232052, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I first noticed all the bright lights, then I realized that little girl was there. She seems to be lost in the darkness. I wonder what this would look like cropped in tighter on the sides, which might draw more attention to the girl herself. She looks very sweet, but I have to kind of squint to see her. (Ofcourse it could be my aging eyes) :-)</td>', 'For me, I first noticed all the bright lights, then I realized that little girl was there. She seems to be lost in the darkness. I wonder what this would look like cropped in tighter on the sides, which might draw more attention to the girl herself. She looks very sweet, but I have to kind of squint to see her. (Ofcourse it could be my aging eyes) :-)', '2005-09-21 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725840, 232994, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love where you''ve placed the man in the frame.  The green and black together are a really nice effect.</td>', 'I love where you''ve placed the man in the frame.  The green and black together are a really nice effect.', '2005-09-21 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725842, 231479, 41675, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was...wow - great colors. I like the stillness of the water. My eyes get pulled slightly over to the bright light on the right, but not too bad. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'My initial reaction was...wow - great colors. I like the stillness of the water. My eyes get pulled slightly over to the bright light on the right, but not too bad. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-21 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725845, 231935, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice city overview. This would be nice in a Chamber of Commerce brochure :-)</td>', 'Nice city overview. This would be nice in a Chamber of Commerce brochure :-)', '2005-09-21 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725849, 232461, 37961, '<td valign="top">I really love the way the tracks are aglow and match the sky! Nice one. 10</td>', 'I really love the way the tracks are aglow and match the sky! Nice one. 10', '2005-09-21 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725853, 233115, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a fun idea.  I would like to see a little more of his face.  It''s too hard to judge his expression here.</td>', 'This is a fun idea.  I would like to see a little more of his face.  It''s too hard to judge his expression here.', '2005-09-21 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725854, 232966, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish it wasn''t such an overcast day. Maybe this would be more enticing if the overall saturation was higher. I like seeing the bus on the dock in comparative size to that HUGE ship. :-)</td>', 'For me, I wish it wasn''t such an overcast day. Maybe this would be more enticing if the overall saturation was higher. I like seeing the bus on the dock in comparative size to that HUGE ship. :-)', '2005-09-21 00:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725857, 230819, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - how funny. Well done.</td>', 'LOL - how funny. Well done.', '2005-09-21 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725860, 233244, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a sense of destination from this photo, but I do like the light reflection on the...boat (?)</td>', 'I don''t get a sense of destination from this photo, but I do like the light reflection on the...boat (?)', '2005-09-21 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725867, 233290, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a nice concept. I like the brilliance of your whites and the hint of color on the rose is a nice touch too. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a nice concept. I like the brilliance of your whites and the hint of color on the rose is a nice touch too. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-21 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725874, 232956, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like it. For me, it''s the beautiful landscape outside the window that makes this shot. It looks like a great destination. I like the look on the woman''s face as well. Good luck in this challenge. 8</td>', 'I like it. For me, it''s the beautiful landscape outside the window that makes this shot. It looks like a great destination. I like the look on the woman''s face as well. Good luck in this challenge. 8', '2005-09-21 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725880, 232295, 41675, '<td valign="top">The photo appears a bit grainy on my monitor, but nice landscape. That moon is very cool to look at.</td>', 'The photo appears a bit grainy on my monitor, but nice landscape. That moon is very cool to look at.', '2005-09-21 00:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725882, 233344, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract image.  It seems a little difficult to tie it to the idea of a destinations, but I like it very much.</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract image.  It seems a little difficult to tie it to the idea of a destinations, but I like it very much.', '2005-09-21 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725884, 231260, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the whites seem overly bright. I wonder how this would look in color as Hawaii is such a beautiful and lush place.</td>', 'For me, the whites seem overly bright. I wonder how this would look in color as Hawaii is such a beautiful and lush place.', '2005-09-21 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725887, 232497, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Makes me think the destination is just over the bridge. I like the lighting. It reminds me of Vermont.</td>', ':-) Makes me think the destination is just over the bridge. I like the lighting. It reminds me of Vermont.', '2005-09-21 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725892, 231513, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring. For me, this would have worked well in the perspective challenge. :-)</td>', 'I like the coloring. For me, this would have worked well in the perspective challenge. :-)', '2005-09-21 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725894, 233101, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. Was it a strike? :)</td>', 'Nice action shot. Was it a strike? :)', '2005-09-21 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725902, 232430, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t like spiders - they give me the creeps (but that doesn''t effect my voting). My eyes kept looking for a fly or some kind of prey that the spider was destined to go after.</td>', 'I don''t like spiders - they give me the creeps (but that doesn''t effect my voting). My eyes kept looking for a fly or some kind of prey that the spider was destined to go after.', '2005-09-21 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725905, 232876, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, very very nice. I must watch too many movies as my initial reaction was Lord of the Rings when they were lighting signal fires from mountain to mountain. :-)</td>', 'Ooooh, very very nice. I must watch too many movies as my initial reaction was Lord of the Rings when they were lighting signal fires from mountain to mountain. :-)', '2005-09-21 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725906, 232996, 37103, '<td valign="top">Really nice image.  I love the greens and orange.  I also especially like the arc of the boys heads, although I do wish there was a bit more room between the top head and the edge of the image.  Wonderful image with lots of destinations implied.</td>', 'Really nice image.  I love the greens and orange.  I also especially like the arc of the boys heads, although I do wish there was a bit more room between the top head and the edge of the image.  Wonderful image with lots of destinations implied.', '2005-09-21 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725909, 231488, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat silhouette. I like the off-centered composition and good sky too.</td>', 'Neat silhouette. I like the off-centered composition and good sky too.', '2005-09-21 00:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725933, 233340, 37103, '<td valign="top">Love the sky!  I was expecting to see cities in this challenge and this is a great rendition.  I love the motion blur of the train.</td>', 'Love the sky!  I was expecting to see cities in this challenge and this is a great rendition.  I love the motion blur of the train.', '2005-09-21 00:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725947, 233362, 4281, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get it. When I look at the picture I see a cemetery and a woman in veil but the title ''Desire'' doesn''t really relate to that. So I''m wondering, is the background of something else than a cemetery and if so, is there any connection between the background and the title?<br/>If it isn''t, then how is one supposed to connect the title ''Desire'' with a veiled woman? Does she perhaps desire freedom or love or something else? I, for one, can''t sense the desire in her face though she appears to be looking at something intensily. <br/> <br/>What, I''m basically saying is that I don''t get this image - I don''t understand it.<br/> <br/>Now, IF the intention was to showcase the desire in the woman''s face I think you''ve failed a bit. The framing of the face is nice for that but the background and the fact that her face is too dark ruin that a bit. However, if the framing of the face had been the same but the background had been much darker and the face brighter this might have been pretty neat picture.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get it. When I look at the picture I see a cemetery and a woman in veil but the title ''Desire'' doesn''t really relate to that. So I''m wondering, is the background of something else than a cemetery and if so, is there any connection between the background and the title?If it isn''t, then how is one supposed to connect the title ''Desire'' with a veiled woman? Does she perhaps desire freedom or love or something else? I, for one, can''t sense the desire in her face though she appears to be looking at something intensily.  What, I''m basically saying is that I don''t get this image - I don''t understand it. Now, IF the intention was to showcase the desire in the woman''s face I think you''ve failed a bit. The framing of the face is nice for that but the background and the fact that her face is too dark ruin that a bit. However, if the framing of the face had been the same but the background had been much darker and the face brighter this might have been pretty neat picture.', '2005-09-21 00:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725948, 233106, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is awesome and powerful. Love to see these Harriers take off and also support us. Nice and clean lines. I gave you a 10.</td>', 'This is awesome and powerful. Love to see these Harriers take off and also support us. Nice and clean lines. I gave you a 10.', '2005-09-21 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725955, 231241, 7304, '<td valign="top">Says it all. Nice image and great cropping and selection.</td>', 'Says it all. Nice image and great cropping and selection.', '2005-09-21 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725957, 233107, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great night time capture.  Love the sign at the left.</td>', 'Great night time capture.  Love the sign at the left.', '2005-09-21 00:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725959, 232346, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the fog rolling in, or clouds, Fits nicely and you did a great job considering the conditions.</td>', 'Great shot of the fog rolling in, or clouds, Fits nicely and you did a great job considering the conditions.', '2005-09-21 00:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725961, 231260, 4281, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but when I looked at the picture I instantly connected it to a funeral as it is in black and white, the flowers on the left don''t look that lively  and the decoration on the bouquet to the right looks a bit like a cross.<br/>Perhaps color would have suited this photograph better?<br/> <br/>Nice tonality though. I''d have kept the background a bit further away in order for the flowers to not cast shodows on it.</td>', 'I''m sorry but when I looked at the picture I instantly connected it to a funeral as it is in black and white, the flowers on the left don''t look that lively  and the decoration on the bouquet to the right looks a bit like a cross.Perhaps color would have suited this photograph better? Nice tonality though. I''d have kept the background a bit further away in order for the flowers to not cast shodows on it.', '2005-09-21 00:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725962, 233039, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow the shock value is great.  I have to know how you did this.  Anyway, spectacular.</td>', 'Wow the shock value is great.  I have to know how you did this.  Anyway, spectacular.', '2005-09-21 00:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725970, 231566, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  The eyes are a little distracting, they are looking up in a kind of unnatural way.  Great pose and I only wish that the background also implied school.</td>', 'Great concept.  The eyes are a little distracting, they are looking up in a kind of unnatural way.  Great pose and I only wish that the background also implied school.', '2005-09-21 00:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1725999, 232969, 4281, '<td valign="top">What I don''t like about this picture is the following:<br/>a) It''s too dark. Try to brighten it a bit using levels or curves.<br/>b) It''s too red/yellow. You should either shoot in RAW or adjust the whitebalance. However, it is possible to fix in Photoshop by creating a curve adjustment layer and using the ''Se Grey Point'' eyedropper (in the middle) to set the grey/neutral point. The shoeboxes would ideal candidates for this.<br/>c)  think you should  have fixed the blemish to the left of her mouth or at least made it a bit less pronounced. (People may not want their blemishes removed with fakery but making it less pronounced shoud still have been possible.)<br/>d) The background is awful, a curtain to the left and some shoeboxes to the right. Try to use larger aperture the next time you have such a background in order to make it go out of focus as much as possible.<br/>e) I would also have liked you to use a bit of fill-flash here, both to lighten up her face and also to get some catchlights in her eyes.<br/>f) It also seems like the picture has gone through some extensive editing as her skin looks a bit strange - posterized probably.<br/>g) Oh, and it''s a bit soft too boot. A slight unsharp mask might be helpful perhaps?</td>', 'What I don''t like about this picture is the following:a) It''s too dark. Try to brighten it a bit using levels or curves.b) It''s too red/yellow. You should either shoot in RAW or adjust the whitebalance. However, it is possible to fix in Photoshop by creating a curve adjustment layer and using the ''Se Grey Point'' eyedropper (in the middle) to set the grey/neutral point. The shoeboxes would ideal candidates for this.c)  think you should  have fixed the blemish to the left of her mouth or at least made it a bit less pronounced. (People may not want their blemishes removed with fakery but making it less pronounced shoud still have been possible.)d) The background is awful, a curtain to the left and some shoeboxes to the right. Try to use larger aperture the next time you have such a background in order to make it go out of focus as much as possible.e) I would also have liked you to use a bit of fill-flash here, both to lighten up her face and also to get some catchlights in her eyes.f) It also seems like the picture has gone through some extensive editing as her skin looks a bit strange - posterized probably.g) Oh, and it''s a bit soft too boot. A slight unsharp mask might be helpful perhaps?', '2005-09-21 01:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726108, 232785, 44593, '<td valign="top">Good thinking , alongwith good composition</td>', 'Good thinking , alongwith good composition', '2005-09-21 03:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726213, 232842, 16636, '<td valign="top">A place I know well - Good luck Ian......</td>', 'A place I know well - Good luck Ian......', '2005-09-21 06:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726225, 233106, 16636, '<td valign="top">Strijing Image, beautifully exposed, good luck</td>', 'Strijing Image, beautifully exposed, good luck', '2005-09-21 07:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726228, 232868, 16636, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crafted image, superb...</td>', 'Beautifully crafted image, superb...', '2005-09-21 07:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
