(1732483, 232888, 2170, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot.  i would love to see it in b/w.</td>', 'this is a great shot.  i would love to see it in b/w.', '2005-09-23 01:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732486, 233303, 2170, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  just gorgeous.</td>', 'beautiful.  just gorgeous.', '2005-09-23 01:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732488, 232039, 2170, '<td valign="top">too dark.</td>', 'too dark.', '2005-09-23 01:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732489, 230917, 2170, '<td valign="top">great shot, but i don''t think it fits the challenge.</td>', 'great shot, but i don''t think it fits the challenge.', '2005-09-23 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732490, 232685, 2170, '<td valign="top">great shot but i don''t think it fits the challenge.</td>', 'great shot but i don''t think it fits the challenge.', '2005-09-23 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732492, 233239, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and exposure. A truly masterful job, Must have been hard to keep your model''s head still. 10</td>', 'Perfect lighting and exposure. A truly masterful job, Must have been hard to keep your model''s head still. 10', '2005-09-23 01:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732495, 232885, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice comp and interesting subject.', '2005-09-23 01:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732496, 232751, 2170, '<td valign="top">i don''t see how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'i don''t see how this fits the challenge.', '2005-09-23 01:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732541, 233104, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know, if the horizon had been straight, I would have given this a 10 in a heartbeat.  But, there''s something about this particular angle that doesn''t speak to me as an artistic choice.  I could certainly be wrong - wouldn''t be the first time by any means!  This is such a dynamically beautiful shot, that it doesn''t need any "gimmicks" to make it better.  The tilted horizon is a big distraction, but the shot is so good that it''s tough to take many points away.  8</td>', 'Ya know, if the horizon had been straight, I would have given this a 10 in a heartbeat.  But, there''s something about this particular angle that doesn''t speak to me as an artistic choice.  I could certainly be wrong - wouldn''t be the first time by any means!  This is such a dynamically beautiful shot, that it doesn''t need any "gimmicks" to make it better.  The tilted horizon is a big distraction, but the shot is so good that it''s tough to take many points away.  8', '2005-09-23 02:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732545, 231803, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful take on this challenge.  I really appreciate the minimalist approach and underlying meaning.  Very good job.</td>', 'Beautiful take on this challenge.  I really appreciate the minimalist approach and underlying meaning.  Very good job.', '2005-09-23 02:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732569, 233239, 26849, '<td valign="top">It''s got the wow factor going for this one. 10. My top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'It''s got the wow factor going for this one. 10. My top pick for this challenge.', '2005-09-23 02:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732612, 233370, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The road has great lines. Placement of your subject is very good, that and the lines command attention to the subject. I really like your treatment of the image. And a good concept for the challenge to boot. Great job.</td>', 'Nice composition. The road has great lines. Placement of your subject is very good, that and the lines command attention to the subject. I really like your treatment of the image. And a good concept for the challenge to boot. Great job.', '2005-09-23 03:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732615, 233288, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The negative space serves the image well IMO. good job</td>', 'Nice composition. The negative space serves the image well IMO. good job', '2005-09-23 03:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732620, 232430, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Good focus. The colors are vivid, but almost seem a little oversaturated to me. I think I see your connection to the challenge, but many may seem it a little loose.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Good focus. The colors are vivid, but almost seem a little oversaturated to me. I think I see your connection to the challenge, but many may seem it a little loose.', '2005-09-23 03:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732622, 231707, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice waterscape shot. Rich colors and I like the reflections.</td>', 'Nice waterscape shot. Rich colors and I like the reflections.', '2005-09-23 03:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732681, 233340, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is a really awesome photo.  Not having seen it I can''t be sure, but I think I may have liked the train to be motionless, but regardless, I do really love this photo.  8.</td>', 'This is a really awesome photo.  Not having seen it I can''t be sure, but I think I may have liked the train to be motionless, but regardless, I do really love this photo.  8.', '2005-09-23 04:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732682, 233111, 10268, '<td valign="top">Outside of the title, I don''t really feel that it meets the challenge, but it''s a nice portrait, and I hope she beats it fast!</td>', 'Outside of the title, I don''t really feel that it meets the challenge, but it''s a nice portrait, and I hope she beats it fast!', '2005-09-23 04:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732687, 232955, 10268, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I can''t help but think with focus this would have been amazing.  <br/> <br/>But it''s sort of intriguing without any focus.  A very odd image indeed, but I think I like it more than I dislike it.  6.</td>', 'Interesting.  I can''t help but think with focus this would have been amazing.   But it''s sort of intriguing without any focus.  A very odd image indeed, but I think I like it more than I dislike it.  6.', '2005-09-23 04:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732688, 233303, 10268, '<td valign="top">I like the overall colors of this a lot.  Or maybe the lack of colors, but it''s nice.  <br/> <br/>I think I''d like to see her a little bigger in the frame though, but still, I like it!</td>', 'I like the overall colors of this a lot.  Or maybe the lack of colors, but it''s nice.   I think I''d like to see her a little bigger in the frame though, but still, I like it!', '2005-09-23 04:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732693, 232089, 10268, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of photos I take myself, and think I''m doing it symetrically, but when I get home, I see it''s not perfect.<br/> <br/>This photos reminds me of all the times.  It''s like all you needed was a step to the right and you''d be symetrical.  Like this it just seems off, but it''s still a really lovely image.  Just would have much more impact the other way.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-26 01:06:42.</i></td>', 'There are a lot of photos I take myself, and think I''m doing it symetrically, but when I get home, I see it''s not perfect. This photos reminds me of all the times.  It''s like all you needed was a step to the right and you''d be symetrical.  Like this it just seems off, but it''s still a really lovely image.  Just would have much more impact the other way.', '2005-09-23 04:17:40.000000', '2005-09-26 02:06:42.000000', 1),
(1732694, 233290, 10268, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and nicely executed.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and nicely executed.', '2005-09-23 04:18:28.000000', NULL, 1);
