(1735227, 231690, 3669, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see the picture rotated to make the light switch even.  Interesting composition.</td>', 'I think I would like to see the picture rotated to make the light switch even.  Interesting composition.', '2005-09-24 04:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735229, 232921, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape photo.  Like the windmill.  Good use of B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice landscape photo.  Like the windmill.  Good use of B&W', '2005-09-24 04:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735230, 232802, 3669, '<td valign="top">Unique composition.  Kudo to your creativity.</td>', 'Unique composition.  Kudo to your creativity.', '2005-09-24 04:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735232, 231782, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colors and focus.  Good job on this close-up  Nice DOF</td>', 'Beatiful colors and focus.  Good job on this close-up  Nice DOF', '2005-09-24 04:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735235, 232295, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and colors.  I really like the moon...nicely placed.  Excellent capture.  Picture appears to be oversharpened as it caused a halo effect along the mountain line and artifact.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and colors.  I really like the moon...nicely placed.  Excellent capture.  Picture appears to be oversharpened as it caused a halo effect along the mountain line and artifact.', '2005-09-24 04:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735236, 233288, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is great! I like the negative space and the desat and the title. All very well done!</td>', 'This is great! I like the negative space and the desat and the title. All very well done!', '2005-09-24 04:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735237, 233362, 3669, '<td valign="top">In this particular picture, the overexposed look of the background doesn''t really appeal to me.  I really lost detail.  Not sure I''m understanding the theme.</td>', 'In this particular picture, the overexposed look of the background doesn''t really appeal to me.  I really lost detail.  Not sure I''m understanding the theme.', '2005-09-24 04:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735239, 232905, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and color.  Really like the sparkles on the water.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and color.  Really like the sparkles on the water.', '2005-09-24 04:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735240, 233115, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.  Not sure I like the blue hue, however, the photo is nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.  Not sure I like the blue hue, however, the photo is nicely done.', '2005-09-24 04:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735241, 233276, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Would have cloned out the amber lights in the background, though.</td>', 'Nice.  Would have cloned out the amber lights in the background, though.', '2005-09-24 04:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735242, 232300, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellently done.  Love the pose and the sunset in the background.  Nice lighting.  I also like the glossy look to the photo.  Only thing that bugs me a little is what looks like a dodge line around the bottom portion of the gals dress.</td>', 'Excellently done.  Love the pose and the sunset in the background.  Nice lighting.  I also like the glossy look to the photo.  Only thing that bugs me a little is what looks like a dodge line around the bottom portion of the gals dress.', '2005-09-24 04:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735243, 232343, 3669, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Perhaps a little overprocessed, but it works well here.  Excellent depth although it kind of looks like the couple is facing a fake backdrop.  Like the selective desaturation.</td>', 'Lovely.  Perhaps a little overprocessed, but it works well here.  Excellent depth although it kind of looks like the couple is facing a fake backdrop.  Like the selective desaturation.', '2005-09-24 04:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735255, 231087, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the yellow/green hue of the clouds.  Otherwise, this picture definately portrays a gloomy doom mood.  The birds add a nice touch.  Excellent capture and perspective.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the yellow/green hue of the clouds.  Otherwise, this picture definately portrays a gloomy doom mood.  The birds add a nice touch.  Excellent capture and perspective.', '2005-09-24 05:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735256, 233098, 3669, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh and you caught a little bit of a yellow hue.  Otherwise, nice idea and good composition.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh and you caught a little bit of a yellow hue.  Otherwise, nice idea and good composition.', '2005-09-24 05:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735258, 231935, 3669, '<td valign="top">Really like the mountains in the background.  They really provide an interesting perspective as the city buildings look miniture in comparison.</td>', 'Really like the mountains in the background.  They really provide an interesting perspective as the city buildings look miniture in comparison.', '2005-09-24 05:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735269, 233237, 28963, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and how the moon peeks through the clouds. Wish the wall had been straight though.</td>', 'I like the colors and how the moon peeks through the clouds. Wish the wall had been straight though.', '2005-09-24 05:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735270, 233258, 28963, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and comppsition. I like the subdues colors but the sky is too dull. Don''''t know wxactly what could be done about that though.</td>', 'Nice angle and comppsition. I like the subdues colors but the sky is too dull. Don''''t know wxactly what could be done about that though.', '2005-09-24 05:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735271, 232295, 28963, '<td valign="top">I like the different layers provided by the rows of hill in different colors. Nice catch to notice that (if you did that on purpose). I like that it''s a bit noisy.</td>', 'I like the different layers provided by the rows of hill in different colors. Nice catch to notice that (if you did that on purpose). I like that it''s a bit noisy.', '2005-09-24 05:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735272, 232296, 35467, '<td valign="top">Won''t ask how you got this photo</td>', 'Won''t ask how you got this photo', '2005-09-24 05:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735273, 231479, 28963, '<td valign="top">Good colors and sharpnes. I think the dock to the right makes it a bit messy, but having the ship off center help that a little.</td>', 'Good colors and sharpnes. I think the dock to the right makes it a bit messy, but having the ship off center help that a little.', '2005-09-24 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735274, 232461, 35467, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I think I would have cropped out the white streak on the top</td>', 'Nice capture, I think I would have cropped out the white streak on the top', '2005-09-24 05:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735275, 232948, 35467, '<td valign="top">Had the ball been in focus this would have scored very well</td>', 'Had the ball been in focus this would have scored very well', '2005-09-24 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735276, 233288, 28963, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Nice black background. If you had manage to control the smoke better, to get it to fully cover the bottom of the chair it would have been great. I find the light on the models face abit to bright. And her pose doesn''t really look that relaxed.</td>', 'Nice idea. Nice black background. If you had manage to control the smoke better, to get it to fully cover the bottom of the chair it would have been great. I find the light on the models face abit to bright. And her pose doesn''t really look that relaxed.', '2005-09-24 06:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735278, 233039, 35467, '<td valign="top">OK .... thats clever</td>', 'OK .... thats clever', '2005-09-24 06:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735279, 233338, 35467, '<td valign="top">Picture postcard ... well done</td>', 'Picture postcard ... well done', '2005-09-24 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735281, 232785, 32147, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.  well done.</td>', 'interesting perspective.  well done.', '2005-09-24 06:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735282, 232952, 35467, '<td valign="top">Who robbed which bank?</td>', 'Who robbed which bank?', '2005-09-24 06:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735283, 233133, 32147, '<td valign="top">I feel this could be a much stronger image if the posts on the front of the house were straight vertical.  The slight angle of that line is a distracting element and it feels that something is not right.</td>', 'I feel this could be a much stronger image if the posts on the front of the house were straight vertical.  The slight angle of that line is a distracting element and it feels that something is not right.', '2005-09-24 06:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
