(1737483, 232955, 44776, '<td valign="top">The track leads me into the picture, but the blur is distracting to me.</td>', 'The track leads me into the picture, but the blur is distracting to me.', '2005-09-25 15:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737491, 232343, 44776, '<td valign="top">I like the selective coloring and the darkened areas in the bottom corners.  The top left corner is very bright.  I probably would have taaken the darkened corners all the way around.  I realize the need to change the license plate, but the dark splotch bothers me.<br/>Overall, a neat picture.</td>', 'I like the selective coloring and the darkened areas in the bottom corners.  The top left corner is very bright.  I probably would have taaken the darkened corners all the way around.  I realize the need to change the license plate, but the dark splotch bothers me.Overall, a neat picture.', '2005-09-25 16:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737493, 233284, 44776, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and love the expression, but the column and upper half of the picture are distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea and love the expression, but the column and upper half of the picture are distracting.', '2005-09-25 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737496, 232296, 44776, '<td valign="top">Bright colors and interesting direction.  Hope you don''t end up there too soon or often.</td>', 'Bright colors and interesting direction.  Hope you don''t end up there too soon or often.', '2005-09-25 16:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737497, 233036, 44776, '<td valign="top">Great location and I like the colors</td>', 'Great location and I like the colors', '2005-09-25 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737499, 233244, 6870, '<td valign="top">The rope is in a good position in the frame. I also like the angles of the lines. I''m not really sure what I''m looking at, though: a ship? a bus? a building? Nice clarity and tones. Good luck!</td>', 'The rope is in a good position in the frame. I also like the angles of the lines. I''m not really sure what I''m looking at, though: a ship? a bus? a building? Nice clarity and tones. Good luck!', '2005-09-25 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737501, 232624, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Subjects are very well placed in the frame. I like the glow of the trees, too. the colors seem quite unnatural, and so bothers me a bit, just because I can''t help but think this would be nice without any color weirdness. Clear image and lovely tones.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Subjects are very well placed in the frame. I like the glow of the trees, too. the colors seem quite unnatural, and so bothers me a bit, just because I can''t help but think this would be nice without any color weirdness. Clear image and lovely tones.', '2005-09-25 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737503, 233097, 44776, '<td valign="top">The black sky contrasts a bit much for me compared to the rest of the photo</td>', 'The black sky contrasts a bit much for me compared to the rest of the photo', '2005-09-25 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737505, 232843, 6870, '<td valign="top">From the title, I suspect that this spider''s destination was "the other side." It may seem a petty thing, but it looks like the spider is walking down the road instead of across it. The only hint you''ve included is the line marker in the middle, and the spider is walking parallel to it. I like the position of the spider in the frame. Tones seem just a tad light and not very deep, so playing with contrast might be worthwhile. If your macro works, it might be fun to get as close as possible to the spider  for some alternative choices. Overall, an interesting, engaging image!</td>', 'From the title, I suspect that this spider''s destination was "the other side." It may seem a petty thing, but it looks like the spider is walking down the road instead of across it. The only hint you''ve included is the line marker in the middle, and the spider is walking parallel to it. I like the position of the spider in the frame. Tones seem just a tad light and not very deep, so playing with contrast might be worthwhile. If your macro works, it might be fun to get as close as possible to the spider  for some alternative choices. Overall, an interesting, engaging image!', '2005-09-25 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737508, 230917, 44776, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus, but the background kind of blends in.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus, but the background kind of blends in.', '2005-09-25 16:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737509, 231566, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clear, interesting portrait. He looks quite posed, and I wonder why he''s looking up. Color balance seems okay on the man, but the background looks yellow. It may be your monitor. I entered a challenge  a while ago and the monitor I was working on showed white, but it was really yellow, just like this. Nice position of the student in the frame. Overall, a nice shot hinting at an interesting destination.</td>', 'Clear, interesting portrait. He looks quite posed, and I wonder why he''s looking up. Color balance seems okay on the man, but the background looks yellow. It may be your monitor. I entered a challenge  a while ago and the monitor I was working on showed white, but it was really yellow, just like this. Nice position of the student in the frame. Overall, a nice shot hinting at an interesting destination.', '2005-09-25 16:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737510, 232994, 44776, '<td valign="top">Nice title, it definetely describes the reflections.</td>', 'Nice title, it definetely describes the reflections.', '2005-09-25 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
