(1737648, 233084, 28963, '<td valign="top">I love the feeling of freedom I get form this image. The fog is great and teh color as well., but maybe ther is a bit too much haze. Not sure.</td>', 'I love the feeling of freedom I get form this image. The fog is great and teh color as well., but maybe ther is a bit too much haze. Not sure.', '2005-09-25 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737658, 233104, 28963, '<td valign="top">Lively colors and I like the coulds (polarizer?).<br/>However, the balance in the iimage is disturbed. The peer is tilted to the right while the horizon to the left. It make my head move right and left all teh time trying to compensate.</td>', 'Lively colors and I like the coulds (polarizer?).However, the balance in the iimage is disturbed. The peer is tilted to the right while the horizon to the left. It make my head move right and left all teh time trying to compensate.', '2005-09-25 17:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737677, 233029, 41277, '<td valign="top">Very good...<br/>i really hope you didnt see it somewhere else.. i sure did..on a photography magazine..<br/>anyway i know how hard it is... 9( 9 - coz the hands that hold her..</td>', 'Very good...i really hope you didnt see it somewhere else.. i sure did..on a photography magazine..anyway i know how hard it is... 9( 9 - coz the hands that hold her..', '2005-09-25 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
