(1737694, 231782, 28963, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and DOF. I love the detail o th butterfly.  Good composition</td>', 'Nice colors and DOF. I love the detail o th butterfly.  Good composition', '2005-09-25 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737698, 233363, 28963, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and I like the cloud pattern, but otherwise I find it rather boring. The border doesn''t seem to add much to the image.At first I didn''t even notice it, and after I did it just distracts me.</td>', 'Good exposure and I like the cloud pattern, but otherwise I find it rather boring. The border doesn''t seem to add much to the image.At first I didn''t even notice it, and after I did it just distracts me.', '2005-09-25 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737700, 232994, 28963, '<td valign="top">Great image. The composition is just awesome. The patterns on the wall are indeed confusing.</td>', 'Great image. The composition is just awesome. The patterns on the wall are indeed confusing.', '2005-09-25 18:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737705, 232996, 28963, '<td valign="top">Greaet DOF. The first boy munk could have been a tad sharper maybe. Ther is some blue colorization in his right eye, but I am being ridiculously picky here. Like it a lot. Bump</td>', 'Greaet DOF. The first boy munk could have been a tad sharper maybe. Ther is some blue colorization in his right eye, but I am being ridiculously picky here. Like it a lot. Bump', '2005-09-25 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737712, 233095, 28963, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop. Would have maybe liked to see the edge of teh right elbow (not sure though). I like the lights and shadows on hos torso (mind you, that is not something I say often :P )</td>', 'Interesting crop. Would have maybe liked to see the edge of teh right elbow (not sure though). I like the lights and shadows on hos torso (mind you, that is not something I say often :P )', '2005-09-25 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737713, 231376, 28963, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to comment about the missing part at the bottom of the moon, but then I looked a whie longer adn I actually think it is a very good call. Not sure if you did this on purpose or not.<br/>Nice focus.<br/></td>', 'At first I was going to comment about the missing part at the bottom of the moon, but then I looked a whie longer adn I actually think it is a very good call. Not sure if you did this on purpose or not.Nice focus.', '2005-09-25 18:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737717, 232868, 28963, '<td valign="top">Like the tone in the image. Also like that it is a bit grainy. The looks on there faces are very good. The whole pose has a nice dynamic feel to it, from the angle she is tilted to the fact that she is holding to his fingers. I am sure they are very pleased with their wedding photographer!</td>', 'Like the tone in the image. Also like that it is a bit grainy. The looks on there faces are very good. The whole pose has a nice dynamic feel to it, from the angle she is tilted to the fact that she is holding to his fingers. I am sure they are very pleased with their wedding photographer!', '2005-09-25 18:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737720, 232802, 28963, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but to me the tie is oversharpened. Otherwise, nice lighting. Not sure I like the composition/idea so much, but I can''t really say what it is.</td>', 'Nice colors but to me the tie is oversharpened. Otherwise, nice lighting. Not sure I like the composition/idea so much, but I can''t really say what it is.', '2005-09-25 18:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737722, 231241, 28963, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here and the idea. Compositionaly I think maybe it would have been better if his arms didn''t run across the middle of the frame like that. Maybe some more table in the bottom of the frame to move the arms up a tad.</td>', 'I like the contrast here and the idea. Compositionaly I think maybe it would have been better if his arms didn''t run across the middle of the frame like that. Maybe some more table in the bottom of the frame to move the arms up a tad.', '2005-09-25 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
