(1738453, 232827, 13688, '<td valign="top">Going down in more ways than one.  On a positive note...all the back page exposure without the 4 score I was destined to recieve.<br/> <br/>I must have been a bit drunker than normal, as I probably could have come up with a conservative site council stamp of approval technique to limit my "underworld funk" attempt to just a true border.  But I was too lazy to revisit it after I posted it.<br/> <br/>I had this bizarre idea that enough people would see it my way, that if you can do it in the film darkroom, it should be allowed.  But alas that concept may never catch on at this site.  But don''t worry if you need to clone out a fence, as that film impossibility is available in dpc''s digital world.<br/> <br/>So I''m bitter, what can I say?   It''s so upsetting that photography is limitedly defined on this site and that definition is fully accepted by most.  <br/> <br/>Though not bitter enough to make this my cliche, exiting rant as you might expect at this point.  I enjoy the site too much.  Moving on, I''ll just have to try harder next time.</td>', 'Going down in more ways than one.  On a positive note...all the back page exposure without the 4 score I was destined to recieve. I must have been a bit drunker than normal, as I probably could have come up with a conservative site council stamp of approval technique to limit my "underworld funk" attempt to just a true border.  But I was too lazy to revisit it after I posted it. I had this bizarre idea that enough people would see it my way, that if you can do it in the film darkroom, it should be allowed.  But alas that concept may never catch on at this site.  But don''t worry if you need to clone out a fence, as that film impossibility is available in dpc''s digital world. So I''m bitter, what can I say?   It''s so upsetting that photography is limitedly defined on this site and that definition is fully accepted by most.   Though not bitter enough to make this my cliche, exiting rant as you might expect at this point.  I enjoy the site too much.  Moving on, I''ll just have to try harder next time.', '2005-09-26 01:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1738457, 233039, 24976, '<td valign="top">wow joey buddy, two blues in one week! <br/> <br/>the shot looks amazing and the execution is flawless. Good job with the happy colors, nice to see you change styles so effortlessly.</td>', 'wow joey buddy, two blues in one week!  the shot looks amazing and the execution is flawless. Good job with the happy colors, nice to see you change styles so effortlessly.', '2005-09-26 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
