(1738963, 232915, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your comments. I was lucky enough to be in this part of the UK during the challenge week (although I had no idea what the challenges were until my return home!) I think this shot fitted ''Destinations'' quite well.<br/> <br/>The scene was taken from the cliffs above Lantic Bay in South Cornwall, UK. This is not accessible by road and is therefore fairly secluded. The path shown leads on and around the headland (our destination) whilst a branch leads steeply down to the bay below.<br/> <br/>The colors are close to how they were on the day, polarized to capture the clarity of the water and saturate the greens.<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Thanks all for your comments. I was lucky enough to be in this part of the UK during the challenge week (although I had no idea what the challenges were until my return home!) I think this shot fitted ''Destinations'' quite well. The scene was taken from the cliffs above Lantic Bay in South Cornwall, UK. This is not accessible by road and is therefore fairly secluded. The path shown leads on and around the headland (our destination) whilst a branch leads steeply down to the bay below. The colors are close to how they were on the day, polarized to capture the clarity of the water and saturate the greens. Chris', '2005-09-26 04:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
