(2115727, 232629, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed!<br/>Traditionally framed print with the trees, but it works well. I use an 8080 wide, and am interested in trying to be a portrait photographer, but am nervous with people and not have head for buisiness. I will try and find out how you got into it, but admire much of what you have done. <br/> <br/>The sky is so blue! A bit rare for England where I am, but love the scenery<br/> <br/>Good luck for the future</td>', 'Very nice indeed!Traditionally framed print with the trees, but it works well. I use an 8080 wide, and am interested in trying to be a portrait photographer, but am nervous with people and not have head for buisiness. I will try and find out how you got into it, but admire much of what you have done.  The sky is so blue! A bit rare for England where I am, but love the scenery Good luck for the future', '2006-02-02 19:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
