(2377874, 231690, 48739, '<td valign="top">well I looked this up.. and this is what i got...<br/> <br/>Main Entry: er·u·di·tion <br/>Pronunciation: "er-&amp;-''di-sh&amp;n, "er-y&amp;-<br/>Function: noun<br/>--extensive knowledge acquired chiefly from books : profound, recondite, or bookish learning<br/>synonym see KNOWLEDGE <br/> <br/>I just wanted to pic at this one...... I like this alot if i was...voting i would be torn between an 8 or a 9... to mee it seems off in the middle i stare and stare  and it looks off... that said.... i love the Idea and the Dodge and bur effect... i can not quite pull this off like this yet...(still working on this) nice idea great capture!! the only thing i would of done is slide the tri pod over to the left just a tad.... i duno you might ask some one else and see if they see what im seeing....</td>', 'well I looked this up.. and this is what i got... Main Entry: er·u·di·tion Pronunciation: "er-&-''di-sh&n, "er-y&-Function: noun--extensive knowledge acquired chiefly from books : profound, recondite, or bookish learningsynonym see KNOWLEDGE  I just wanted to pic at this one...... I like this alot if i was...voting i would be torn between an 8 or a 9... to mee it seems off in the middle i stare and stare  and it looks off... that said.... i love the Idea and the Dodge and bur effect... i can not quite pull this off like this yet...(still working on this) nice idea great capture!! the only thing i would of done is slide the tri pod over to the left just a tad.... i duno you might ask some one else and see if they see what im seeing....', '2006-05-03 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
